 "text": "Government of India\nEnglish (English)\nAPI Directory\nAbout Us\nExplore APIs\nResources\nExplore by Sector\nBlog\nDashboard\nLog In\nCreate Account\n Back\nLegislative Department\n All StatesCentral GovernmentLegal & Judiciary\n\nProvided by : IndiaCode\n\nSubscribe\n\nAPIs CollectionsAbout\nTry in Sandbox\nIndiaCode API\nFetch specific browse index details\nView or Download Bitstream Content File\nFetch Bitstream Metadata\nFetch entries for a browse index\nFetch list of browse indexes\nFetch list of collections\nFetch collection by UUID\nFetch single community by UUID\nFetch list of communities\nFetch items for a browse index entry\nFetch collections under a community\nFetch search endpoints summary\nExecute search query across DSpace repository\nFetch facet values for search\nFetch sub-communities of a community\nIndiaCode APIFetch specific browse index details\nDocumentationPerformanceAlertsAPIs Consumers\nSelect Code Snippet\nC\nC#-restsharp\nC#-httpclient\nGo\nJava-asynchttp\nJava-nethttp\nkotlin\nJava-unirest\nJavaScript-jquery\nJavaScript-xhr\nNodeJs-native\nNodeJs-request\nNodeJs-unirest\nNodeJs-axios\nNodeJs-fetch\nobjc-nsurlsession\nOCaml-cohttp\nPHP-curl\nPHP-http1\nPHP-http2\nPowerShell-webrequest\nPowerShell-restmethod\nPython-python3\nPython-requests\nR\nRuby\nShell-curl\nShell-httpie\nShell-wget\nSwift-nsurlsession\nIndiaCode API\n 1.0.0 \nOAS 3.0\n\nIndiaCode is a comprehensive database of all Central enactments in force and their subordinate legislation, as amended or issued from time to time. It simplifies access to updated Central Acts and their associated subordinate legislation through a user-friendly and accessible digital platform.\n\n\n\n\nThe database also includes legislation enacted by State Governments and Union Territory Administrations, along with their respective subordinate legislation.\n\n\n\n\nAPI Groups\n\n\n\n\n\nIndiaCode Core Bitstream GET APIs (Metadata & Download/View Content)\n\n\n\n\n\nRetrieves bitstream metadata and enables users to download or view the associated content of legislative documents.\n\n\n\n\n\nIndiaCode Discover/Browse GET APIs\n\n\n\n\n\nEnables browsing and discovery of legislative resources and related repository content.\n\n\n\n\n\nIndiaCode Collections REST API\n\n\n\n\n\nRetrieves information about collections containing legislative documents and related resources.\n\n\n\n\n\nIndiaCode Communities REST GET APIs\n\n\n\n\n\nRetrieves information about repository communities and their associated legislative resources.\n\n\n\n\n\nIndiaCode Discover/Search GET APIs\n\n\n\n\n\nEnables searching for legislative documents and related resources based on specified search criteria.\n\n\n\n\n[Updated on 27th October 2026]\n\nTerms of service\nIndiaCode - Website\nServers\nhttps://beta.api-setu.in - UAT Server\nAuthorize\nBitstream APIs\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/core/bitstreams/{uuid}\nFetch Bitstream Metadata\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/core/{uuid}/content\nView or Download Bitstream Content File\nBrowse APIs\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/discover/browses\nFetch list of browse indexes\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/discover/browses/{browseId}\nFetch specific browse index details\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/discover/browses/{browseId}/entries\nFetch entries for a browse index\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/discover/browses/{browseId}/items\nFetch items for a browse index entry\nCollections APIs\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/core/collections\nFetch list of collections\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/core/collections/{uuid}\nFetch collection by UUID\nCommunities APIs\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/core/communities\nFetch list of communities\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/core/communities/{uuid}\nFetch single community by UUID\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/core/communities/{uuid}/subcommunities\nFetch sub-communities of a community\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/core/communities/{uuid}/collections\nFetch collections under a community\nSearch APIs\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/discover/search/\nFetch search endpoints summary\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/discover/search/objects\nExecute search query across DSpace repository\nGET\n/molj/indiacode/srv/server/api/discover/search/facets/{facetName}\nFetch facet values for search\nSchemas\nBitstreamMetadata\nAbout Us\nExplore APIs\nSOP for API Access\nBlog\nFAQs\nDashboard\nUtilities\nAPI Policy\nData Standards\nDevelopers\nDigilocker\nInformation Videos\nPowered By\n\nDigital India Corporation (DIC)\n\nNational e-Governance Division (NeGD) Ministry of Electronics & IT (MeitY) Government of India\n\nWebsite designed & developed by National eGovernance Division (NeGD)\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nContact Us\n\nAPIs | APISetu",
